8. Scoring system

Implement a transparent, deterministic scoring model.

Base score:

* 10 points per second survived.

Collectibles:

* 25 points per shard multiplied by the active combo multiplier.

Perfect Shift:

* 40 additional points per qualifying obstacle.

All score values must be calculated from the game state, not from rendered frames.

Use integer scores and avoid floating-point accumulation bugs.

Persist the best score in localStorage.

Also persist:

* Sound preference.
* Reduced-motion preference, if manually changed.

Handle unavailable or corrupted localStorage gracefully.

No account or backend should be required.

